.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH restore 1  "restore " 
.SH NAME
restore \- Restore snippets from a backup archive
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBrestore\fR [\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIFILE\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Restore snippets from a backup archive
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-config\fR
Also restore config.yaml from the archive
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Overwrite without asking (same as \-y)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIFILE\fR]
Backup file (default: the newest in the backups directory)
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  fg restore ~/forgehub\-backup.tar
